IRRIGATION NOTES

Automatic irrigation systems shall comply with TCEQ Chapter 344, as well as the following requirements:
1. These requirements shall be noted on the Site Development Permit and shall be implemented as part of the landscape inspection:
a. the system must provide a moisture level adequate to sustain growth of the plant materials;
b. the system does not include spray irrigation on areas less than ten (10) feet wide (such as medians, buffer strips, and parking lot islands);
